FAMILY 3 — positions / auto-placement (src/state/store.ts)
----------------------------------------------------------
Behavior: placementSeq is MONOTONIC (never reused) so auto-placed slots never
collide across a removeStage.

PASS (baseline):
  $ npx vitest run src/state/store.test.ts -t "canvas positions"
        Tests  6 passed | 79 skipped (85)

BREAK: stop incrementing placementSeq (slots become reusable) —
  sed -i 's|placementSeq: s.placementSeq + 1,|placementSeq: s.placementSeq, // (mutation) not monotonic|' src/state/store.ts

FAIL (broken, expected):
  $ npx vitest run src/state/store.test.ts -t "canvas positions"
     × addStage auto-places at the monotonic seq slot (column-flow)
     × placementSeq is monotonic across removeStage (never reused, compaction-immune)
   FAIL  … > addStage auto-places at the monotonic seq slot (column-flow)
   FAIL  … > placementSeq is monotonic across removeStage …
   AssertionError: expected { x: 300, y: 40 } to deeply equal { x: 560, y: 40 }
        Tests  2 failed | 4 passed | 79 skipped (85)

RESTORE: git checkout src/state/store.ts → Tests 6 passed | 79 skipped (85)


